Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excited to
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they didn't arm a Digivolb,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we never would have saved Davis and\NBeemon from that evil Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:02:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go back tomorrow and\Nreally give them a piece of my mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx150\fscy150\pos(321,328)}Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, just a few\Nsimple modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The classroom is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm still\Ntaking the spelling test.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.41,0:02:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear someone coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smells like Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I stink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is! Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you me, Monty, did you\Nguys have a good day at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your link?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and Cody, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both on their way over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, here's someone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought goodies from my\Nfamily's convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:02:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interning Digimon are bottomless pits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my family owned a convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd eat candy all day long\Nuntil my teeth fell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that glamorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to pay for anything I\Neat, even when I work there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the job comes with\Na great pension plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we eat it? I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The buffet is now open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best thing I've\Never eaten in my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All two days of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hot! It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hope
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first litter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't act like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check to see if the gate's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the digital world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody's not here. Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's taking him so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still in the lunchroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time I checked, he was still\Nchewing the same carrot 50 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have one more tomato to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to eat every bite, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should never throw away\Nany food unless it smells bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father used to say that\Nbefore he passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he know we're waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's holding us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's watch some TV to pass the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.86,0:04:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's see what's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We interrupt this broadcast to\Nbring you this latest story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The results of the National Computer\NProgramming Contest were just announced,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the winner is boy genius Ken Ichijoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were many well-deserving\Ngeniuses out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I am humbled to think that the\Njudges chose me to receive the top prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go live to the side of the contest\Nwith our field reporter, Jerry Rivera.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerry? Thanks, Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young Ken wowed the judges\Nby creating a computer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,program that can actually\Nbrush your teeth for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rumor is, next year, he's\Nplanning something with floss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken's talents include being able to play\None game of chess while everyone watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just last week, he actually balanced\Nthe world's biggest checkbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a champion in judo and a\Nstar on the All-State soccer team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, girls, he's single.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's almost as good as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's talk to the proud\Nparents who raised this genius, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Mrs. Ichijoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are some of the\Nadvantages of being the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mother of one of the\Nmost brilliant children
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the world oh it's great in the kitchen\Nhe invented dishes that clean themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.64,0:05:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like father like son i once guessed how
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,many jelly beans were\Nin a pickle jar i heard
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this kid is so smart\Nthat one time he gave his
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,teachers homework cody\Nwhen did you get here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about a minute ago hey maybe ken knows how
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:06:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To defeat the Digimon\NEmperor, I know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about the digital world\Nthan that stupid kid
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be stupid but\Nhe's still a genius, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari yeah we're ready to\Ngo back to the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world now all president\Naccounted for let's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.44,0:06:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get going the gate to the digital world is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,open then what are we\Nwaiting for yeah Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forget all this talk about geniuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next stop, the digital world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a winner at the computer contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the boy genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat it, you made your little mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I'll call the pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken, you're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to work now, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave your snack on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bought a new label maker today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't stop playing with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even labeled the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken sure spends a lot of\Ntime alone in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use trying to\Nhide from me! Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, which is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a little errand to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not as fun if I catch it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He caught another Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all change once he puts\Nthose dark rings around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he thinks he's going to catch\Nus, he's got rocks in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, so do we.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't abandon our friend Elecmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's making them fight each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, who our friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would never hurt each other if\Nthey weren't under his evil spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He enjoys watching their agony!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a terrible person!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can they find their best friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, is this really the kind\Nof thing that makes you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We change back when we\Nreturn to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, a digi-egg. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digivice says it's not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More digi-eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already have ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never know unless we look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you want, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's those kids again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's getting pretty\Ndark in these woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Kari, I'll hold your\Nhand so you don't get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, TJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not his name. It's TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh, I'm getting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just up there ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's just an illusion he's\Nnot really there who do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think you are sneaking\Ninto the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you think this\Nis a movie theater or
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something what's he talking\Nabout ordinary children
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are not allowed in the\Ndigital world only the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digidestined are huh\Nwe are the Digidestined
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wonder boy you the\NDigidestined that's physically
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,impossible why is that\Nimpossible yeah why can't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on the laws of physics,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have determined that only perfect\Nhuman beings can be Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, I am the\Nonly perfect human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Big Shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are intruders in a place\Nwhere you don't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are ordered to hereby evacuate\Nthe premises without further notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The landlord told my uncle the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have just as much\Nright to be here as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world and everything in\Nit belongs to me now all of you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get out try and make us Why must\Neveryone question my authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it always have to turn\Ninto a great big production?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, Tyrannomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the most powerful Digimon his\Nblaze blast attack incinerates his enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for me Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VMan Armored Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters.\NDigimon are the champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters, Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the Fire of Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, this is why I'm a\Ngenius and you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You keep using the same attacks against me,\Nyet I keep coming up with something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of your babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! He blocked it! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Yolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon, Armor Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Possumon, Wings of Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blaze Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can beat me\Nwith a little addition?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like multiplication?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are five of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready, Armadimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadigival to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the druggers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the drill of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not let us digivolve so we can fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I have this dark digivice,\Nyou'll never be able to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you two are useless, I\Nmight as well destroy you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the cats are always\Nsupposed to land on their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you have some\Ncavities that need filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the old saying, it's\Nnot how you play the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's whether you win or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to go and try to\Nfind the other Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Cody, we don't even\Nknow who it belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:15:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon, let's look for\Nthe other Digi-Eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest Wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can run, but you can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to go through\Nme first to get to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom, Bubba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Batman, it's no use! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hide in that cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:15:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're digi eggs. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiter on for a new kid to come along and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lift it so another new\Ndigimon will be born?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there aren't any\Nmore Digidestined left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those symbols\Non the front of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them is the Crest of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the other one has the Crest of Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.86,0:16:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then these Digi-Eggs must\Nbelong to the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try to\Nlift them up, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't try, you'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we've already got our Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catobon's right. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digivices are glowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the same digivices\Nthat the new kids have. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.41,0:17:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Armor Digivolve, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon, flying home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, armor Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon, the angel of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.30,0:18:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon and Patamon were\Nable to armor Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon, you're beautiful,\Nbut the best part is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that you can fly, we\Ndon't have to walk anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These wings aren't broken in yet. T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, my very own armored Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys give up yet? Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going to run to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Connie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Pegasmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one wild horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he attacks with his star shower, his\Nenemy will be blasted into outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's Nefertimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.26,0:18:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is a flying fighting\Nmachine with nine lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she's quite a shot when tossing\Nthose Rosetta stones of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think Armored\NDigivolving will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before I figure\Nout how to stop that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden Noose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark rings disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i want to get a digital picture\Nof this from my computer scrapbook
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these photos turned out\Ngreat except the tyrannomon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all have red eye oh wait a\Nminute i forgot they always
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have red eyes i'm so mad\Njust wait till i get my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on that digimon emperor\Nyou'll defeat the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:19:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't you, T .K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, Kari, but\Nwe'll give it our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is we've never faced\Nan enemy who was human before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we fight him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brings up a very interesting\Npoint we should all consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.49,0:20:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What point is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.41,0:20:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is quite a little\Narmy we've put together so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've met our three new Digimon, and\Nthey've been able to armor Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even Gatomon and\NPatamon have found a way to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bypass the Digimon Emperor's\NDark Digivice as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even with all our power combined\Nwe still haven't had the strength to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat the digimon emperor in the digital\Nworld yet we still keep forgetting
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fact that he's human yeah but i\Nstill don't get it what's your point
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he means we have to fight differently\Nhow do you suggest we do that if we
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find out his human identity maybe we\Ncan defeat him from this side where his
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powers aren't as strong what do we do\Nknock on doors asking for the digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,emperor i knew i shouldn't have expressed\Nmy opinions now they'll all just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make fun of me well you're a little\Nyoung to be worrying about those Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:21:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just let us older kids\Ncome up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's another day.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.53,0:21:22.65,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.65,0:21:28.64,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.64,0:21:34.55,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.55,0:21:40.64,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.72,0:21:46.74,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.74,0:21:52.57,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.57,0:21:58.30,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:22:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I want to open\Nthe door to the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.30,0:22:04.29,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll open the door for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.29,0:22:10.19,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.19,0:22:19.05,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,open the door for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gorgeous life!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.65,0:22:29.45,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the gate is open.
